<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mis Enlaces</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f4f4f6;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 400px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: block;
            background: white;
            color: #333;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #333;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>¡Hola! 👋</h1>
        <p>Bienvenidos a mis enlaces</p>
        
        <a href="https://instagram.com" class="btn" target="_blank">Instagram</a>
        <a href="https://tiktok.com" class="btn" target="_blank">TikTok</a>
        <a href="https://open.spotify.com" class="btn" target="_blank">Spotify</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
